@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = COLE_O_JWT
@analyticsToken = COLE_O_TOKEN_ELEVADO
@deviceKey = COLE_A_CHAVE_DO_DISPOSITIVO
@date = 2026-10-07

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.com","password":"CONFIGURE_SENHA"}

### Usuário operador
POST {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Operador","email":"operador@example.com","password":"CONFIGURE_SENHA_SEGURA","role":"OPERADOR"}

### Tipo
POST {{base}}/api/screws
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"M6","description":"Parafuso sextavado","specifications":"Aço; 20 mm"}

### Dispositivo: guarde apiKey retornada
POST {{base}}/api/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deviceId":"ESP32-001","name":"Máquina 1"}

### Configure o ID do tipo com a resposta anterior
POST {{base}}/api/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operationId":"OP-2026-001","target":10000,"screwTypeId":1,"deviceId":"ESP32-001"}

### Iniciar (ajuste ID do lote)
POST {{base}}/api/batches/1/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Evento: atualize o timestamp para o instante real, após início
POST {{base}}/api/production/events
X-Device-Key: {{deviceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deviceId":"ESP32-001","operationId":"OP-2026-001","eventId":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","timestamp":"2026-10-07T12:30:15Z"}

### Repita o evento exatamente igual para verificar idempotência
### Estado
GET {{base}}/api/batches/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Histórico
GET {{base}}/api/batches/1/events?page=0&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pausar
POST {{base}}/api/batches/1/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retomar
POST {{base}}/api/batches/1/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Finalizar: primeiro pare a máquina e esvazie a fila
POST {{base}}/api/batches/1/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Analytics
POST {{base}}/api/auth/analytics/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"password":"CONFIGURE_SENHA_ANALYTICS_OU_DO_USUARIO"}

### Total diário
GET {{base}}/api/analytics/daily?date={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{analyticsToken}}

### Produção por hora
GET {{base}}/api/analytics/hourly?from={{date}}&to={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{analyticsToken}}

### Relatório
GET {{base}}/api/analytics/report/pdf?from={{date}}&to={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{analyticsToken}}
